.
.  Generate sample output for Lognormal PDF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na lgnpdf4.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE SIZE 6
TITLE OFFSET 3
LABEL SIZE 6
TIC LABEL SIZE 6
LABEL CASE ASIS
Y1LABEL Probability Density
X1LABEL X
Y1LABEL DISPLACEMENT 13
FRAME CORNER COORDINATES 20 20 90 90
THICKNESS 0.2
.
MULTIPLOT 2 2
MULTIPLOT CORNER COORDINATES 0 0 100 100
.
TITLE Lognormal PDF (sigma = 0.5)
PLOT LGNPDF(X,0.5) FOR X = 0.01 0.01 5
TITLE Lognormal PDF (sigma = 1)
PLOT LGNPDF(X,1) FOR X = 0.0 0.01 5
TITLE Lognormal PDF (sigma = 2)
PLOT LGNPDF(X,2) FOR X = 0.01 0.01 5
TITLE Lognormal PDF (sigma = 5)
PLOT LGNPDF(X,5) FOR X = 0.01 0.01 5
.
END OF MULTIPLOT
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system cp LGNPDF4.PS lgnpdf4.ps
system rm LGNPDF4.PS
.
quit
